# No launch profile is committed. Set ASPNETCORE_URLS=http://localhost:5080 for the isolated local test host.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080
@token = replace-with-a-local-test-token

### Read capability without sending any child records (JWT and directory admission required)
GET {{baseUrl}}/v2/sleep-predictions/capabilities
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Synthetic-only fixture. Update now to current UTC before using an isolated test deployment.
# Disabled by default; do not enable against real children without the documented rollout gates.
POST {{baseUrl}}/v2/sleep-predictions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "inputRevision": "aaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaaa",
  "consentVersion": "sleep-ai-v1",
  "familyId": null,
  "membershipId": null,
  "historyId": null,
  "ageDays": 100,
  "timeZone": "Australia/Melbourne",
  "now": "2026-10-12T08:00:00Z",
  "records": [
    {"kind": "sleep", "start": "2026-10-12T02:00:00Z", "end": "2026-10-12T03:00:00Z", "ongoing": false, "feedKind": null, "amountMl": null},
    {"kind": "feed", "start": "2026-10-12T03:10:00Z", "end": "2026-10-12T03:20:00Z", "ongoing": false, "feedKind": "formula", "amountMl": 120}
  ]
}

### Malformed context must be rejected, not treated as personal-data authorization
POST {{baseUrl}}/v2/sleep-predictions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"schemaVersion": 1, "inputRevision": "invalid"}
